Song Title: Jesus, All for Jesus
Artist / Author:
Writers: Words and music by Jennifer Atkinson and Robin Mark
Release year: 1991
CCLI song #:
Order: Verse 1, Verse 2, Chorus, Verse 3, Verse 1, Verse 2, Chorus, Verse 3

Verse 1
Jesus, all for Jesus
